      kx:   Nat v0 and Nat v1 and Nat v2 and Nat v3 and Nat v4 and ImpCode c6 c7 c5 and ImpCode c8 c9 c7
              and ImpCode c10 c11 c9 and TimesAt v0 v2 v4 c11 and PlusAt v3 v0 v4 c10 and TimesAt v0 v1 v3 c8
              and SuccAt v1 v2 c6
                                          by and_i n0 n1 n2 n3 n4 ic5 ic7 ic9 k0 k1 k2 k3
      cx:   TsCode c5                     by exists_i kx
      qx:   QAx c5                        by or_i cx
      pc5:  PrH h c5                      by imp_e prh_axiom QAx fs0 prf fc5 qx
      pc7:  PrH h c7                      by imp_e prh_mp QAx fs0 prf fc7 ic5 pc5 p0
      pc9:  PrH h c9                      by imp_e prh_mp QAx fs0 prf fc9 ic7 pc7 p1
      pc11: PrH h c11                     by imp_e prh_mp QAx fs0 prf fc11 ic9 pc9 p2
      therefore forall c5 c7 c9. (Form c5 and ImpCode c6 c7 c5 and Form c7 and ImpCode c8 c9 c7 and Form c9 and ImpCode c10 c11 c9)
                  -> PrH h c11
    r: PrH h c11                          by exists_e e code
    therefore forall h v0 v1 v2 v3 v4 c6 c8 c10 c11. Nat v0 -> Nat v1 -> Nat v2 -> Nat v3 -> Nat v4
                -> TimesAt v0 v2 v4 c11 -> PlusAt v3 v0 v4 c10 -> TimesAt v0 v1 v3 c8 -> SuccAt v1 v2 c6
                -> PrH h c6 -> PrH h c8 -> PrH h c10 -> Form c11 -> PrH h c11
