    variable h v0 v1 c2 c3 c4 c5 c6
    assume n0:  Nat v0
    assume n1:  Nat v1
    assume k0:  ImpCode c3 c4 c2
    assume k1:  ImpCode c5 c6 c4
    assume k2:  ZeroAt v1 c6
    assume k3:  ZeroAt v0 c5
    assume k4:  EqAt v0 v1 c3
    assume fc3: Form c3
    assume fc5: Form c5
    assume fc6: Form c6
    fc4: Form c4                          by imp_e fim fc5 fc6 k1
    fc2: Form c2                          by imp_e fim fc3 fc4 k0
    kx:  Nat v0 and Nat v1 and ImpCode c3 c4 c2 and ImpCode c5 c6 c4 and ZeroAt v1 c6 and ZeroAt v0 c5
           and EqAt v0 v1 c3
                                          by and_i n0 n1 k0 k1 k2 k3 k4
    cx:  EzCode c2                        by exists_i kx
    qx:  QAx c2                           by or_i cx
    pc2: PrH h c2                         by imp_e prh_axiom QAx fs0 prf fc2 qx
    therefore forall h v0 v1 c2 c3 c4 c5 c6. Nat v0 -> Nat v1 -> ImpCode c3 c4 c2 -> ImpCode c5 c6 c4
                -> ZeroAt v1 c6 -> ZeroAt v0 c5 -> EqAt v0 v1 c3 -> Form c3 -> Form c5 -> Form c6 -> PrH h c2
  therefore FS0 -> FORM -> PRF QAx -> forall h v0 v1 c2 c3 c4 c5 c6. Nat v0 -> Nat v1 -> ImpCode c3 c4 c2
              -> ImpCode c5 c6 c4 -> ZeroAt v1 c6 -> ZeroAt v0 c5 -> EqAt v0 v1 c3 -> Form c3 -> Form c5
              -> Form c6 -> PrH h c2
